---
import BaseHead from "../components/BaseHead.astro";
import Footer from "../components/Footer.astro";
import Header from "../components/Header.astro";
import { SITE_TITLE } from "../consts";
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <BaseHead title={`About - ${SITE_TITLE}`} description="Learn about how this website is editable via AI-powered coding tools" />
  </head>
  <body>
    <Header />
    <main>
      <h1>About This Website</h1>
      <p>
        This website is fully editable using AI-powered coding tools like <a href="https://v0.dev">v0</a>. Instead of manually editing files or managing complex deployments, you can use an AI assistant to make changes to your codebase directly.
      </p>
      
      <h2>How It Works</h2>
      <ol>
        <li><strong>Import the project:</strong> Import this GitHub repository into v0 or your favorite AI-powered coding tool</li>
        <li><strong>Make changes:</strong> Describe what you want to change, and the AI will generate the code modifications</li>
        <li><strong>Preview:</strong> Preview your changes in real-time before committing</li>
        <li><strong>Open a Pull Request:</strong> Submit your changes as a pull request on GitHub</li>
        <li><strong>Review and Merge:</strong> The repository admin reviews and merges the PR</li>
        <li><strong>Auto-deploy:</strong> Once merged to the main branch, GitHub Actions automatically deploy the changes to the live site</li>
      </ol>

      <h2>Why This Approach?</h2>
      <p>
        This workflow combines the power of AI-assisted development with modern DevOps practices. You get:
      </p>
      <ul>
        <li>✨ Fast, intelligent code generation</li>
        <li>🔍 Real-time preview and iteration</li>
        <li>🔒 Code review before deployment</li>
        <li>🚀 Automated deployment on merge</li>
        <li>📝 Full git history and version control</li>
      </ul>

      <p>
        Whether you're updating content, adding new features, or redesigning sections, this approach makes web development more accessible and collaborative.
      </p>
    </main>
    <Footer />
  </body>
</html>
